@startuml
title "评论数据聚类分析时序图"

actor User
database Database
participant "数据准备" as DataPreparation
participant "文本特征处理" as TextFeatureProcessing
participant "TF-IDF向量化" as TFIDFVectorization
participant "数据标准化" as DataNormalization
participant "K均值聚类" as KMeansClustering
participant "地域信息解析" as RegionParsing
participant "评分占比计算" as ScorePercentageCalculation
participant "输出统计信息" as OutputStatistics
participant "绘制散点图" as ScatterPlotDrawing
participant "绘制图表" as OverallPlotDrawing

User -> DataPreparation: 评论数据请求
DataPreparation -> Database: 读取评论数据
DataPreparation -> TextFeatureProcessing: 选择文本特征，合并为一个文本特征列
TextFeatureProcessing -> TFIDFVectorization: TF-IDF向量化
TFIDFVectorization -> DataNormalization: 数据标准化
DataNormalization -> KMeansClustering: K均值聚类
KMeansClustering -> RegionParsing: 地域信息解析
RegionParsing -> ScorePercentageCalculation: 计算评分占比
ScorePercentageCalculation -> OutputStatistics: 输出统计信息
OutputStatistics -> User: 输出每个聚类的评论数量和评分占比
User -> ScatterPlotDrawing: 绘制散点图请求
ScatterPlotDrawing -> User: 散点图绘制完成
User -> OverallPlotDrawing: 绘制整体图表请求
OverallPlotDrawing -> User: 整体图表绘制完成

@enduml
